      paragraphs: [
        `None of the content strategy above produces anything if the pages cannot be crawled, indexed and rendered. In a low-volume market this matters more, not less, because you have fewer queries to win and cannot afford to lose any of them to a configuration error.`,
        `The checks that actually find problems on capital-market sites: whether every service page is in the sitemap and indexed, which Search Console will tell you by exclusion reason; whether Arabic and English pages are correctly paired with hreflang and self-referencing canonicals, which is the single most common bilingual error; whether the site is rendered on the server or depends on JavaScript that a crawler may not execute; whether PDF documents, which capital sites carry a lot of, are indexable, titled properly and linked from a real page rather than orphaned; and whether redirects from an older site were ever implemented.`,
        `Structured data is worth more here than its reputation suggests, because institutional pages are exactly the kind of content that answer engines and AI assistants quote. Organisation details, service descriptions, address and contact data, and frequently asked questions marked up accurately all help a machine understand what you do and who you are. None of it is a ranking trick; it is making a factual page machine-readable.`,
        `Speed deserves its own mention because bilingual, document-heavy corporate sites in the capital are routinely slow for Arabic visitors specifically, due to font loading and layout shift that nobody has measured. That is a real, fixable problem and it is covered in detail on <a href='/uae/website-speed-optimization-uae/'>website speed optimization for UAE sites</a>. The broader crawl and indexing programme sits on <a href='/uae/technical-seo-services/'>technical SEO services</a>.`,
        `Do the technical repair before buying content. Publishing new pages onto a site with indexing problems is paying twice: once to write them, and again later to make them visible.`,
      ],
